  "title": "Tata Group Leadership Transition and Governance Concerns",
  "summary": "Tata Group Chairman N Chandrasekaran announced his resignation amid leadership concerns and disagreements with the Tata Trusts board, with the succession process and governance issues central to the company's leadership changes. The Tata Trusts has called for his reappointment, citing potential governance problems.",
